<!-- COVER -->
<div class="cover">
  <h1>B-Edge</h1>
  <h2>Booking Domain — Visual Flows</h2>
  <div class="cover-meta">
    <div class="cover-badge">Version 1.0</div>
    <div class="cover-badge">2026 · Confidential</div>
    <div class="cover-badge">Companion to Booking Domain Specification v1.0</div>
    <div class="cover-badge">Beauty at the Edge · الجمال عند الحافة</div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="container">

<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<!-- 1. STATE MACHINE -->
<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<div class="section">
  <div class="section-header">
    <div class="section-num">1</div>
    <div class="section-title">Booking Status — State Machine</div>
  </div>
  <div class="section-subtitle">Every booking has a status. Transitions are one-way. Click any status to see full details.</div>

  <div class="states-grid" id="states-grid"></div>
  <div class="detail-panel" id="state-detail">
    <div style="color:#888;font-size:14px">Click any status above to see its details, transitions, and business rules.</div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="divider"></div>

<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<!-- 2. FULL FLOW -->
<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<div class="section">
  <div class="section-header">
    <div class="section-num">2</div>
    <div class="section-title">Full Booking Flow</div>
  </div>
  <div class="section-subtitle">The complete journey from slot selection to completed appointment.</div>

  <div class="flow-grid">
    <div>
      <div class="flow-col-title">👤 Customer journey</div>
      <div class="flow-step">
        <div class="flow-num" style="background:#e0e7ff;color:#4338ca">1</div>
        <div class="flow-body">
          <div class="flow-title">Browse available slots</div>
          <div class="flow-detail">Selects artist, store, service, and date. The slot algorithm runs and returns available windows.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flow-connector"></div>
      <div class="flow-step">
        <div class="flow-num" style="background:#ede9fe;color:#7c3aed">2</div>
        <div class="flow-body">
          <div class="flow-title">Tap a slot → <code>held</code></div>
          <div class="flow-detail">Slot locked for 10 minutes. GIST constraint ensures first-write-wins. If two customers tap simultaneously, one succeeds instantly — the other gets SLOT_UNAVAILABLE.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flow-connector"></div>
      <div class="flow-step">
        <div class="flow-num" style="background:#dbeafe;color:#1d4ed8">3</div>
        <div class="flow-body">
          <div class="flow-title">Submit form → <code>pending</code></div>
          <div class="flow-detail">Fills in special requests (optional). Submits. Artist receives a WhatsApp notification immediately.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flow-connector"></div>
      <div class="flow-step">
        <div class="flow-num" style="background:#f0fdf4;color:#15803d">4</div>
        <div class="flow-body">
          <div class="flow-title">Wait for artist approval</div>
          <div class="flow-detail">Artist reviews in their dashboard. Approves or rejects. No time limit on pending duration.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flow-connector"></div>
      <div class="flow-step">
        <div class="flow-num" style="background:#fef3c7;color:#92400e">5</div>
        <div class="flow-body">
          <div class="flow-title">Pay deposit → <code>approved</code></div>
          <div class="flow-detail">Transfer deposit via Wish Money before the 48-hour deadline. Artist verifies and marks deposit received → <code>deposit_paid</code>. Artist then confirms → <code>confirmed</code>.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flow-connector"></div>
      <div class="flow-step">
        <div class="flow-num" style="background:#d1fae5;color:#065f46">6</div>
        <div class="flow-body">
          <div class="flow-title">Booking confirmed ✓</div>
          <div class="flow-detail">Both parties receive WhatsApp confirmation. System automatically sends 24h and 2h reminders.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flow-connector"></div>
      <div class="flow-step">
        <div class="flow-num" style="background:#f1f5f9;color:#475569">7</div>
        <div class="flow-body">
          <div class="flow-title">Attend → <code>completed</code></div>
          <div class="flow-detail">Artist performs service and marks completed. Customer receives a review link via WhatsApp.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div>
      <div class="flow-col-title">🎨 Artist journey</div>
      <div class="info-card">
        <div class="info-card-title">📱 WhatsApp notification arrives</div>
        <div class="info-card-body">"New booking request from [Customer]" — includes service name, time, and any special requests.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="info-card">
        <div class="info-card-title">✅ Approve or reject</div>
        <div class="info-card-body">Approve → system sets deposit_deadline = appointment_time − 48 hours. Customer is notified via WhatsApp with the exact deadline and deposit amount.<br><br>Reject → booking becomes cancelled. Slot freed immediately. Customer notified.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="info-card">
        <div class="info-card-title">💰 Deposit verification queue</div>
        <div class="info-card-body">Artist sees pending deposits in their dashboard. Verifies transfer in Wish Money app. Taps "Mark deposit received" (deposit_paid). Then taps "Confirm booking" (confirmed).<br><br>Two-step process prevents accidental confirmations.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="info-card">
        <div class="info-card-title">📅 Day of appointment</div>
        <div class="info-card-body">Perform the service. Mark as completed, no-show, or cancel from the dashboard.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="info-card danger">
        <div class="info-card-title" style="color:#b91c1c">⏰ If deposit deadline passes</div>
        <div class="info-card-body" style="color:#7f1d1d">Background job runs every minute. Booking auto-transitions to expired. Slot released immediately. Waitlist triggered. No action required from artist.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="divider"></div>

<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<!-- 3. CANCELLATION -->
<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<div class="section">
  <div class="section-header">
    <div class="section-num">3</div>
    <div class="section-title">Cancellation Policy</div>
  </div>
  <div class="section-subtitle">The 24-hour cancellation window is configurable per salon. Default is 24 hours before the appointment.</div>

  <div class="cancel-grid">
    <div class="cancel-card">
      <div class="cancel-scenario">Customer cancels · &gt;24h before</div>
      <div class="cancel-deposit">Deposit: <span class="tag tag-green">Full refund</span></div>
      <div class="cancel-status">Status: <code>refund_due</code></div>
      <div class="cancel-note">Artist must transfer via Wish Money. System tracks through refund_due → refunded. Customer gets WhatsApp confirmation when refund is sent.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="cancel-card">
      <div class="cancel-scenario">Customer cancels · &lt;24h before</div>
      <div class="cancel-deposit">Deposit: <span class="tag tag-red">Forfeited</span></div>
      <div class="cancel-status">Status: <code>cancelled</code></div>
      <div class="cancel-note">Artist keeps the full deposit. No refund is issued. Customer notified immediately via WhatsApp.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="cancel-card">
      <div class="cancel-scenario">Customer no-show</div>
      <div class="cancel-deposit">Deposit: <span class="tag tag-red">Forfeited</span></div>
      <div class="cancel-status">Status: <code>no_show</code></div>
      <div class="cancel-note">Artist marks no-show in dashboard. Deposit kept. No-show recorded for analytics. Customer receives no refund.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="cancel-card">
      <div class="cancel-scenario">Artist cancels · any time</div>
      <div class="cancel-deposit">Deposit: <span class="tag tag-green">Full refund — always</span></div>
      <div class="cancel-status">Status: <code>refund_due</code></div>
      <div class="cancel-note">Artist always bears the cost of cancelling. Customer receives WhatsApp with refund notice and amount. No exceptions.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="cancel-card">
      <div class="cancel-scenario">Deposit deadline passes</div>
      <div class="cancel-deposit">Deposit: <span class="tag tag-amber">N/A — never paid</span></div>
      <div class="cancel-status">Status: <code>expired</code></div>
      <div class="cancel-note">Background job auto-transitions. No deposit was ever paid. Slot freed immediately. Waitlist triggered.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="cancel-card">
      <div class="cancel-scenario">No deposit required</div>
      <div class="cancel-deposit">Deposit: <span class="tag tag-amber">N/A</span></div>
      <div class="cancel-status">Status: <code>cancelled</code></div>
      <div class="cancel-note">Service had deposit_amount = 0. No financial impact. Slot freed immediately on cancellation.</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="refund-flow">
